{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25410","headline":"早入中书行公主册礼事毕登集贤阁成咏 · 李德裕","name":"早入中书行公主册礼事毕登集贤阁成咏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"明星入东陌，灿灿光层宙。\n皎月映高梧，轻风发凉候。\n金门列葆吹，钟室传清漏。\n简册自中来，貂黄忝宣授。\n更登天禄阁，极眺终南岫。\n遥羡商山翁，闲歌紫芝秀。\n晨兴念始辱，夕惕思致寇。\n倾夺非我心，凄然感田窦。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李德裕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25410.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25410","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}